  "body": "This PR introduces a feature which enables the auth library to acquire bound access-tokens and bound id-tokens in Agentic Environments.\r\n\r\n1) We detect certs in default paths and check if they match the SPIFFE format for agents.\r\n\r\n2) If 1. is a yes then we call the MDS endpoint in a POST request with the certificate in the body.\r\n\r\nNote this PR was based on https://github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-java/pull/13169",
